 life will you spend on the toilet? About a year - so bring a good book. (I recommend this one.) \n\nSo sit back, relax, put on some rubber gloves and let a doctor take you on a poo- and puke-filled tour of your insides.","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/6af1ZwnzDiEHmw93nATUw-EaOb6naNiXke5CPmuA03Y.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/YmHFCEyJP9XYWgEnQKpjCkRW_7AN3MQ8yVdT8ygolZA"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":20165,"fileSize":326910537,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2021-08-12T09:45:53.511Z"}},"cardId":"8MfDS","createdAt":"2021-02-16T10:47:08.731Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-10T12:32:15.752Z","clubAvailability":[],"sortkey":"kay-s-anatomy"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}